  <translations>
    <en>
      <description>Rain Bird 100-PGA-9V is a professional 1″ solenoid valve with a 9 V DC latching solenoid for battery-powered controllers. It is suitable for controlling irrigation zones in gardens and professional landscapes where permanent electrical wiring to the valve is not available. The valve supports inline or angle installation. PGA series pressure reaches about 10.4 bar; flow should be selected for the system design.</description>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>b0</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>b00</_key>
