          <text>Size 1″; operating pressure 1,04–10,4 bar; flow 2–40 GPM (0,45–9,08 m³/h); solenoid 9 V DC latching. Actual flow depends on pipe, filter and fitting losses as well as available pressure.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
