          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Connection: 1″ female BSP thread. Before installation, confirm flow direction, operating pressure and thread standard. Fit the valve in an accessible valve box and flush the pipework before commissioning. During service, inspect the diaphragm, pilot filter, solenoid and seals. For flows below 2.27 m³/h, set the flow-control stem two full turns from fully open.</text>
